{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104810/extras/76b2620988555fdf0e2982bec3229f01.avif?t=1768324188\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Story:</strong> After years apart, you return to visit a friend you\u2019ve known your whole life. <br>It was supposed to be a quiet evening \u2014 but soon, you realize you\u2019re not as alone as you thought.<br>Slowly, you uncover a betrayal far darker than you could ever imagine.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104810/extras/e1c09d66274b84fe7c1b800e347ed700.poster.avif?t=1768324188\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104810/extras/e1c09d66274b84fe7c1b800e347ed700.webm?t=1768324188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104810/extras/e1c09d66274b84fe7c1b800e347ed700.mp4?t=1768324188\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay:\u00a0</strong>The game is a first-person experience with a linear story, where players explore environments and uncover secrets, all presented in a retro PSX-style graphics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104810/extras/43b2568f0ec613e7db41b48a3fb88c1f.poster.avif?t=1768324188\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104810/extras/43b2568f0ec61